#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:3
msgid ""
"This record covers the {download}`48-item ledger <../design/build-system-"
"execution.csv>`. Its requirements and original exit conditions remain "
"unchanged. The qualified code source is "
"`cc6a065c002041234a212a964be863a69198f9b4`, tree "
"`de0e687f659a22badb55259b2e03646fc7b748d1`. Later changes to these documents"
" record this code source and do not claim a new code execution at their "
"HEAD. The {download}`result index <build-system-results.json>` binds actual "
"receipts, archive navigation and byte identities. The fixed primary "
"execution index is `/workspace/nexus-build-maintenance-20261012/final-"
"qualification/formal-execution-evidence-index-cc6a065c00.json`, SHA-256 "
"`b42e1857f6802cbabe35d10f515fd9033ee3bb0bbb40368a50222927c5a45e47`."
msgstr ""
"本记录覆盖 {download}`48 项台账 <../design/build-system-"
"execution.csv>`，要求和原始退出条件保持不变。已资格化的代码源码为 "
"`cc6a065c002041234a212a964be863a69198f9b4`，tree 为 "
"`de0e687f659a22badb55259b2e03646fc7b748d1`。后续文档变更只记录此代码源码，不声称在各自 HEAD "
"上重新执行代码。{download}`结果索引 <build-system-results.json>` "
"绑定实际回执、归档导航和字节身份。固定主执行索引为 `/workspace/nexus-build-"
"maintenance-20261012/final-qualification/formal-execution-evidence-index-"
"cc6a065c00.json`，SHA-256 为 "
"`b42e1857f6802cbabe35d10f515fd9033ee3bb0bbb40368a50222927c5a45e47`。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:14
msgid ""
"The implemented build path remains one authored TOML assembly, immutable "
"typed IR and static typed factory, with one CMake target graph executed by "
"Ninja. Configuration owns atomic publication and selected hardware facts; "
"CMake owns software dependencies and scoped compile/link policy. Products "
"continue to own application sources, composition, scheduling and deployment "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"构建路径仍为一份手写 TOML 装配、不可变类型化 IR 和静态类型化工厂，通过唯一 CMake 目标图由 Ninja "
"执行。配置负责原子发布和选定硬件事实；CMake 负责软件依赖及限定范围的编译／链接政策。产品继续负责应用源码、装配、调度和部署政策。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:20
msgid "Final-source software gates"
msgstr "最终源码软件门禁"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:22
msgid ""
"The exact staged code tree passed ordinary commit hooks, including the "
"complete TDD and commit-message gates. The index and behavioral source "
"stayed unchanged through execution. The subsequent canonical GitHub commit "
"contains the same tree. Final qualification separately executes the clean "
"committed source with fresh unfiltered discovery and reports. No hook "
"bypass, test filter, empty report or skipped-only execution establishes "
"acceptance."
msgstr ""
"精确的暂存代码树通过普通 commit hooks，包括完整 TDD 和提交消息门禁。执行期间 index 和行为源码保持不变，后续 canonical"
" GitHub 提交包含相同 tree。最终资格另外针对干净的已提交源码进行全新、未过滤发现与执行。绕过 "
"hook、测试过滤、空报告或仅跳过的执行都不能建立验收。"

