#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:66
msgid ""
"The final-source push run [38294880491](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/actions/runs/38294880491) completed with `success`: 29 successful "
"jobs, zero failed jobs, and one expected main-only `Documentation / Deploy "
