"最终源码 push run [38294880491](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/actions/runs/38294880491) 以 `success` 完成：29 个成功 job、零失败 "
"job，以及一次预期的仅 main 执行 `Documentation / Deploy to Pages` 跳过。所有 job "
"页面、实际日志和产物元数据目录均已保留。回执将 run、jobs 和引用工作流绑定到精确 canonical 代码源码。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:73
msgid ""
"The four Native debug/release/ASan/TSan profiles each execute their complete"
" reported CTest and GoogleTest scopes. ARM, Cortex-M, OS, provider, "
"installed SDK, quality and security scopes retain their actual individual "
"results. All 27 artifact ZIP bytes were downloaded, digest-checked and CRC-"
"checked. Twenty-six Nexus job identities and 25 required selected-dependency"
" closures were verified; the Pages ZIP retains GitHub artifact byte identity"
" without a Nexus job identity. The sealed CI index covers 131 files / "
"104,572,091 bytes."
msgstr ""
"四种 Native debug／release／ASan／TSan profile 分别执行各自完整报告的 CTest 和 GoogleTest "
"范围。ARM、Cortex-M、OS、provider、安装 SDK、质量与安全范围保留独立实际结果。全部 27 份产物 ZIP 字节已下载并进行摘要和"
" CRC 校验；验证了 26 个 Nexus job 身份与 25 个必需的选定依赖闭包。Pages ZIP 保留 GitHub 产物字节身份，但没有 "
"Nexus job 身份。密封 CI 索引覆盖 131 个文件／104,572,091 bytes。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:81
msgid ""
"The earlier `acc70f30` run [38280227545](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/actions/runs/38280227545) failed and remains failed evidence. Its "
"successful Native jobs do not qualify the failed aggregate run or this later"
" source. The fixes make scoped preparation receipts match actual selected "
"dependency closures, separate canonical-budget byte tampering from measured "
"authored-budget overruns, bind expected ThreadX link failure to the exact "
"Ninja ELF edge, and execute all four Python tool domains through the "
"maintained complete runner. Each fix retains real RED/GREEN execution and "
"independent review. The subsequent `3e7c0d50` run also failed: three Tool "
"Contract cases still addressed the removed GD32 helper. Its full raw "
"196-case execution remains failed evidence; `cc6a065c` restores the checked "
"contract entry point and retains the helper semantics. The final passing run"
" above must establish this correction separately."
msgstr ""
"较早 `acc70f30` run [38280227545](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/actions/runs/38280227545) 失败，仍保留失败证据。其成功 Native jobs 不能资格化失败的汇总 "
"run 或后续源码。修复让限定范围的准备回执匹配实际选定依赖闭包，分开 canonical budget 字节篡改与实测手写预算超限，将预期 "
"ThreadX 链接失败绑定到精确 Ninja ELF edge，并通过维护中的完整执行器运行四个 Python 工具域。每项修复保留真实 "
"RED／GREEN 执行和独立审查。后续 `3e7c0d50` run 也失败：三个 Tool Contract 用例仍指向已删除的 GD32 "
"helper。其完整 196 用例原始执行仍为失败证据；`cc6a065c` 恢复经过检查的契约入口并保留 helper 语义。上面的最终成功 run "
"独立建立此修正结果。"

