#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:97
msgid ""
"Eight exact H743/U575 reference profiles pass two fresh network-disabled "
"builds per profile: H743 HSI64 with Cache off and U575 MSIS4 with TZEN=0, "
"each with empty/UART selection and baremetal/FreeRTOS backend. The matrix "
"records sixteen fresh builds and 32 actual network-none container commands. "
"It does not qualify H743 Cache/DMA or U575 dual-domain firmware."
msgstr ""
"八个精确 H743／U575 参考 profile 各通过两次全新断网构建：H743 HSI64／Cache off 和 U575 "
"MSIS4／TZEN=0，分别组合 empty／UART 及裸机／FreeRTOS。矩阵记录十六次全新构建、32 条实际 network-none "
"容器命令，不资格化 H743 Cache／DMA 或 U575 双域固件。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:103
msgid ""
"The actual selected-image resource observations are below. Flash LOAD counts"
" physical initialization bytes; footprint includes the occupied address "
"span. Reserved RAM includes the 2,048-byte MSP once and zero heap, rather "
"than measured stack high water. These are separate selections, not MCU cycle"
" or latency results."
msgstr ""
"下面记录实际所选镜像的资源观察。Flash LOAD 统计物理初始化字节，footprint 包含占用地址跨度。预留 RAM 仅计一次 "
"2,048-byte MSP，heap 为零，并非实测栈峰值。这些是不同选择，不是 MCU cycles 或延迟结果。"

