#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:119
msgid ""
"The immutable Native/tool/SDK proof remains under `cc6a065c`; the new "
"candidate execution uses the separate `cc6a065c00` namespace. The same clean"
" committed Source SDK bytes are fully reverified and copied into independent"
" fresh build roots. No failed matrix output or compiled object is reused."
msgstr ""
"不可变 Native／工具／SDK 证明仍位于 `cc6a065c`，新候选执行使用独立 `cc6a065c00` 命名空间。同一干净、已提交的 "
"Source SDK 字节经过完整复核，复制到独立全新构建根目录，不复用失败矩阵输出或已编译对象。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:124
msgid ""
"The same source, clean Source SDK, authored configuration, recursive "
"dependency pins, compiler/toolchain and OCI identities bind the executed "
"commands and actual ELF/BIN/map/resource bytes. Each candidate passes the "
"owned verifier and an actual fixed-checker `dev candidate` plan. Each "
"complete archive is streamed and verified before only its owned live profile"
" scratch is retired. Original live artifact paths then remain historical "
"locators; the result index supplies the archive and member-relative "
"navigation used for current verification."
msgstr ""
"相同源码、干净 Source SDK、手写配置、递归依赖 pin、编译器／工具链和 OCI 身份绑定实际命令以及 "
"ELF／BIN／map／资源字节。各候选通过自有校验器和实际 fixed-checker `dev candidate` "
"plan。每份完整归档先流式校验，之后仅清退该 profile 自有 live scratch。原始 live "
"产物路径成为历史定位符；结果索引提供当前校验使用的归档及成员相对导航。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:132
msgid ""
"Two earlier matrices remain failed with zero qualified profiles: the first "
"exhausted storage during reproduction, and the second passed two fresh "
"builds but could not seal after temporary SDK reference files had been "
"cleaned up. Independent review restored 102 exact original references from "
"precaptured identities and verified source and original SDK proof records "
"unchanged. The failed scratch was fully archived before retirement. These "
"are storage operations; they do not add source behavior, a new SDK test "
"execution or platform support. The new matrix uses the separate `cc6a065c00`"
" namespace and qualifies all eight profiles from its own fresh builds and "
"actual executed candidate plans."
msgstr ""
"此前两个矩阵保持失败，资格化 profile 为零：首个在复现中耗尽存储，第二个完成两次全新构建，但临时 SDK "
"引用文件被清理后无法封存。独立审查从事先捕获的身份恢复 102 个精确原始引用，并验证源码及原始 SDK 证明未变。失败 scratch "
"在清退前完整归档。这些存储操作不增加源码行为、新 SDK 测试执行或平台支持。新矩阵使用独立 `cc6a065c00` "
"命名空间，依据自己的全新构建和实际候选计划资格化八个 profile。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:142
msgid ""
"Independent archive-only review passed for all eight archives after every "
"original live profile was absent. It verified 168,468 members / 150,508 "
"files and 3,356,224,498 uncompressed file bytes, executed the owned "
"candidate verifier on each packed candidate, and independently reconstructed"
" and fully verified each packed Source SDK. Private temporary copies were "
"removed afterward. The same source and matrix remained unchanged. The main "
"receipt is `/workspace/nexus-build-maintenance-20261012/independent-"
"review/candidate-archive-audit/final-eight-archive-only-independent-"
"review.json`, SHA-256 "
"`1c127cb2a348b62e07809cfa7ce7b784f57c45cac7cca3f58922c5e973817c12`. Local "
"archive retention does not establish off-site replication or publication. "
"Candidates remain unsigned software candidates, with no product-release or "
"hardware acceptance claim."
msgstr ""
"所有原始 live profile 消失后，八份归档均通过独立 archive-only 审查。验证 168,468 个成员／150,508 "
"个文件、3,356,224,498 个未压缩文件字节，实际运行每份打包候选的自有校验器，并独立重建和完整验证打包 Source "
"SDK。随后删除私有临时副本，源码和矩阵保持不变。主回执为 `/workspace/nexus-build-"
"maintenance-20261012/independent-review/candidate-archive-audit/final-eight-"
"archive-only-independent-review.json`，SHA-256 为 "
"`1c127cb2a348b62e07809cfa7ce7b784f57c45cac7cca3f58922c5e973817c12`。本地归档保留不建立异地复制或发布。候选仍为无签名软件候选，不声称产品发布或硬件验收。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:154
msgid ""
"The maintained `tools/dev/plans/software.json` declares 72 reviewed stages. "
"The individual software gates and eight actual candidate plans are recorded "
"separately. **The complete 72-stage plan did not execute end-to-end through "
"one qualification-plan invocation.** Its plan contracts and genuine failed-"
"checker fixtures establish orchestration behavior; no separate execution is "
"invented."
msgstr ""
"维护中的 `tools/dev/plans/software.json` 声明 72 个已审查阶段。各独立软件门禁和八个实际候选计划分别记录。**完整 "
"72 阶段计划没有通过一次 qualification-plan 调用端到端执行。** 其计划契约和真实失败检查器夹具建立编排行为，不虚构独立执行。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:160
msgid "Offline tools and environment boundaries"
msgstr "离线工具和环境边界"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:162
msgid ""
"The final Linux x86_64 CP312 lock contains 15 hash-locked wheels. A fresh "
"CP312 virtual environment executes a no-index, hash-required installation. "
"Actual `pre-commit install --install-hooks` primes the Python hook with "
"PEP517 build isolation enabled, and the isolated interpreter executes the "
"complete tool domains. Setuptools is included for local PEP517 backend "
"preparation; the hook has its exact PyYAML, pre-commit and clang-format "
"runtime closure. Vendored nested wheel metadata remains covered by the "
"whole-wheel digest, while top-level canonical distribution identity and "
"duplicate metadata are checked strictly."
msgstr ""
"最终 Linux x86_64 CP312 lock 含 15 个摘要锁定 wheel。全新 CP312 虚拟环境实际执行 no-"
"index、必需摘要安装。实际 `pre-commit install --install-hooks` 在启用 PEP517 构建隔离时准备 "
"Python hook，隔离解释器执行完整工具域。Setuptools 用于本地 PEP517 后端准备；hook 具有精确 PyYAML、pre-"
"commit、clang-format 运行闭包。Vendored 嵌套 wheel 元数据由整个 wheel 摘要覆盖；顶层 canonical "
"distribution 身份和重复元数据严格检查。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:171
msgid ""
"CP311 wheel bytes are verified against the declared lock. CP311 installation"
" is `not_executed`. The original 14-wheel runtime bundles remain historical "
"artifacts and are not relabelled as the new hook closure. Linux is the "
"executed host scope; Windows/macOS integration and non-Linux descendant "
"cancellation remain untested."
msgstr ""
"CP311 wheel 字节已按声明 lock 校验；CP311 安装为 `not_executed`。原始 14-wheel runtime "
"包保留为历史产物，没有重标为新 hook 闭包。实际主机范围为 Linux；Windows／macOS 集成及非 Linux 子孙进程取消仍未测试。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:176
msgid ""
"The recorded OCI and full ARM toolchain archives were actually transported, "
"restored and byte-verified at their own recorded source scopes. The new "
"candidate builds consume those same artifact identities. The OCI's "
"Python/Git observations remain distinct from the development host. This "
"proves artifact reuse, not recipe reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"记录的 OCI 和完整 ARM 工具链归档在各自源码范围内实际运输、恢复并逐字节校验。新候选构建消费同一产物身份。OCI 的 Python／Git "
"观察与开发主机不同。这证明产物复用，不证明 recipe 重建。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:182
msgid ""
"The recipe declares fixed base/frontend digests, Debian snapshot and five "
"exact APT packages, plus the hash of the final CP312 requirements. Emitted "
"Dockerfile and ephemeral proxy-CA contracts are verified. Reconstruction of "
"the observed OCI image bytes has not executed successfully; "
"`recipe_reproducible` stays `false`."
msgstr ""
"Recipe 声明固定 base／frontend 摘要、Debian snapshot、五个精确 APT 包和最终 CP312 "
"requirements 摘要。生成 Dockerfile 与临时 proxy-CA 契约已校验。观察到的 OCI "
"镜像字节尚未成功重建，`recipe_reproducible` 保持 `false`。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:188
msgid "Reading the 48-item ledger"
msgstr "阅读 48 项台账"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:190
msgid ""
"`implemented_software_validated` records a completed mechanism with final-"
"source software evidence. More specific states retain measured decisions, "
"actual tool installation/transport, verified archive restoration and "
"truthful scope limits. They do not turn every requirement into a physical or"
" product exit condition."
msgstr ""
"`implemented_software_validated` "
"记录已完成机制和最终源码软件证据。更精确的状态保留实测决策、真实工具安装／运输、归档恢复校验和真实范围边界，不把所有要求转为物理或产品退出条件。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:195
msgid ""
"BLD-18 retains full SDK byte checks at each consuming boundary after "
"measurement; no persistent verification bypass is introduced. BLD-31 retains"
" measured compiler unit and selected linked-image costs without a "
"speculative source split. Their `decision_verified` states are intentional "
"results. Prior timing/cache/LTO measurements retain their original source "
"and selected-profile identities."
msgstr ""
"BLD-18 经测量后仍在各消费边界完整核验 SDK 字节，没有持久校验绕过。BLD-31 保留实测编译单元与所选链接镜像成本，不作推测性拆源。其 "
"`decision_verified` 是有意记录的结果。此前 timing／cache／LTO 测量保留原始源码和所选 profile 身份。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:201
msgid ""
"BLD-38 records actual candidate plans while explicitly retaining the absence"
" of one complete 72-stage software-plan invocation. BLD-39 verifies the "
"dependency upgrade validator's evidence contracts; a real vendor dependency "
"upgrade was not performed. BLD-40 records actual CP312 installation and hook"
" isolation, and preserves the missing CP311 installation. BLD-42 retains "
"declared-recipe versus successful reconstruction as separate states. BLD-44 "
"records actual preserved current archives and archive-only verification, "
"without claiming off-site storage."
msgstr ""
"BLD-38 记录实际候选计划，同时明确保留没有完整 72 阶段调用的事实。BLD-39 "
"校验依赖升级检查器的证据契约，没有实际升级厂商依赖。BLD-40 记录实际 CP312 安装及 hook 隔离，保留未执行 CP311 "
"安装。BLD-42 将声明 recipe 与成功重建分开。BLD-44 记录当前归档实际保留和 archive-only 校验，不声称异地存储。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:209
msgid ""
"Earlier normal-hook failures, the isolated-environment installation failure "
"and the failed GitHub run remain immutable failed attempts. Later passing "
"attempts use new receipts and never overwrite their historical outcomes. No "
"physical station is connected: every HIL result remains `not_executed`. This"
" iteration makes no new MCU cycle/WCET, electrical, power-loss, cache/DMA "
"coherence, TrustZone isolation, external-example, certification or product-"
"release claim."
msgstr ""
"此前普通 hook 失败、隔离环境安装失败和 GitHub run 失败都保留不可变失败尝试。后续通过尝试使用新回执，不覆盖历史结果。没有连接物理 "
"station，所有 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`。本轮不增加 MCU cycles／WCET、电气、掉电、cache／DMA "
"一致性、TrustZone 隔离、外部示例、认证或产品发布声明。"
